    narr:narration """On 2026-07-28, the deployment gate is established as settled operational policy rather than a proposal. [Quinton's declarative speech](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) states the requirement: every Meridian deployment requires a signed release manifest before shipping. An [editorial decision summary](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) follows, distilling the gate into three bullet points: the [gate requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) (signed release manifest for Meridian deploys), the [scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) (staging and production), and the [owner](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_6) (Quinton Fairweather). The register across all children is technical-formal, conviction is decision-level, and power framing is legitimate authority — Quinton both voices and owns the rule. The hub covers requirement, scope, and ownership of a deployment gate but does not address enforcement mechanism, exception process, or environments outside staging and production.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_6> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_6> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Scope is limited to staging and production — dev, test, and other environments are unaddressed, leaving the gate's boundary implicit rather than exhaustive." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Quinton both voices the gate requirement and is named its owner — self-authorization with no separate ratifying authority surfaced." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_6> ] ;
